      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. I'm also worried about why this happened so suddenly. The maintenance logs show no issues, but the cooling system just seems to be failing for no reason even though the power is on. Is there any specific way we should investigate if there's a mechanical fault or if something else might have messed with the settings during transit?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
